@buddy_HostAddress = http://localhost:5193

### Create a medicine schedule for a child (guardian only)

POST {{buddy_HostAddress}}/medicines/children/{{childId}}/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{guardianToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Name": "Amoxicillin",
  "Dosage": "5 ml",
  "Icon": "pill",
  "Color": "#ff8800",
  "Times": ["08:00:00", "20:00:00"],
  "StartDate": "2025-06-01",
  "EndDate": "2025-06-10"
}

###

# List a child's medicine schedules (guardian only)
GET {{buddy_HostAddress}}/medicines/children/{{childId}}/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{guardianToken}}

###

# List a child's doses in a date range (child or guardian)
GET {{buddy_HostAddress}}/medicines/children/{{childId}}/doses?from=2025-06-01&to=2025-06-01
Authorization: Bearer {{childToken}}

###

# Mark a dose taken (child or guardian)
PUT {{buddy_HostAddress}}/medicines/children/{{childId}}/doses/{{medicineId}}?date=2025-06-01&time=08:00:00
Authorization: Bearer {{childToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Status": "Taken"
}

###
